[Admin]
<h2>Netstorm 11.01 Local Server</h2>
<p>{TIME}Server administration</p>
<p>Player commands require server administrator access.</p>
<p>Select a zone to list its players. Empty zones have no players.</p>
<a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,0X1)">0</a> | <a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,1X1)">1</a> | <a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,2X1)">2</a> | <a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,3X1)">3</a> | <a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,4X1)">4</a> | <a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,5X1)">5</a> | <a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,6X1)">6</a> | <a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,7X1)">7</a> | <a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,8X1)">8</a> | <a href="cmd:Tell,ZSEND(ADMIN,GETPLAYER,9X1)">9</a><br>
